{%- comment -%}
  Thermora — single-page storefront (feature/thermawell).

  PRODUCT (changed 18 Aug): "Smart Rechargeable Bandage Knee Pad Joint Pain
  Massager", CJ SKU CJYD243764802BY, grey only, one size. Verified specs —
  claim NOTHING beyond these:
    * 5 infrared heat levels: 45 / 50 / 55 / 60 / 65 °C
    * 3 vibration intensities: gentle / comfortable / strong
    * 30-minute automatic shut-off; one-touch screen lock
    * 3000 mAh battery, USB-C, 5 V / 7 W, 360 g
    * Wrap 46 cm across x 30 cm tall, 55 cm strap span; fits either knee
    * Three fabric layers: windproof outer, infrared middle, non-slip inner
    * Large LCD showing battery, temperature and intensity
    * Box: massager + USB-C cable + manual
  THREE JOINTS: knee, shoulder and elbow. The owner confirmed the box includes
  an EXTENSION STRAP, and the supplier's own lifestyle image shows the same
  wrap on a shoulder, an upper arm, a knee and a thigh. Copy across the page
  says knee/shoulder/elbow, and the chips carry shoulder and elbow conditions
  alongside the knee ones.
  NOTE: the CJ packing list reads "Massager x1 + USB x1 + Manual x1 + Box x1"
  and does NOT list the strap. Confirm with CJ before shipping, because the
  page promises it in the box.

  PATCHED supplier asset: the "3 Vibration Intensities" graphic labelled its
  top setting "Knee Pain Relief". That is a therapeutic claim on a device we
  make no medical claims for, so the two lines were painted out and replaced
  with "Deep Massage" in the same typeface. Source kept in the media folder.

  EXCLUDED supplier assets: the "48~58°C / 3 heating levels" black-unit image
  (contradicts this model's 5 levels and colour), and the duplicate vibration
  graphic. The 5-heat-level image had "Relieve knee discomfort, pain and
  arthritis" printed under the heading — that band was cut out before use
  (ASA/CAP §12: no treatment claims for named conditions).

  MEDIA MAP: th-hero (slot 1, product front/back) · th-heat-levels (slot 2,
  the 45–65°C table) · th-controls (slot 3, LCD + big buttons, aimed at the
  45+ buyer) · th-fit-dimensions (slot 4, "will it fit") · th-vibration (slot 5,
  3 intensities — "Knee Pain Relief" label patched out, see below) ·
  th-in-box (slot 6, contents) · th-in-use (§identification) · th-fabric + th-vibration
  (§mechanism duo) · th-strap-fit (§fit) · th-detail-1..3 (detail strip) ·
  th-ce-certificate (CE badge link). th-usage-steps.jpg is retired: its caption
  text was unreadable on a phone, so the steps are now HTML in §mechanism.

  HONESTY GUARDS unchanged: sale pricing only renders while the sale is on,
  review count and founder note hidden until real, add-on promises only what
  the owner controls.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign lp_product = section.settings.product
  if lp_product == blank or lp_product.id == blank
    assign lp_product = all_products['thermora-heated-joint-massager']
  endif

  comment
    Packs are now REAL VARIANTS with their own baked-in prices — no discount
    codes doing the work. Single / Pair / Family are matched by the position
    of the "Pack" option so renaming a variant can't silently break the page.
  endcomment
  assign v_single = lp_product.variants[0]
  assign v_pair = lp_product.variants[1]
  assign v_family = lp_product.variants[2]

  assign wired = false
  if v_single and v_single.available and v_single.price > 0 and v_pair and v_family
    assign wired = true
  endif

  comment
    Summer Sale is a Shopify AUTOMATIC discount (no code, applies to every
    pack including the single). The page mirrors the same percentage so the
    displayed price always equals what checkout charges. If the sale is
    switched off in admin, untick it here too.
  endcomment
  assign sale_end = section.settings.sale_end | default: '2026-09-01T23:59:59+01:00'
  assign now_s = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign end_s = sale_end | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign sale_pct = section.settings.sale_percent | default: 10
  assign sale_on = false
  if section.settings.sale_enabled and now_s < end_s and sale_pct > 0
    assign sale_on = true
  endif
  assign keep = 100 | minus: sale_pct

  assign single_list = v_single.price
  assign pair_list = v_pair.price
  assign fam_list = v_family.price
  if sale_on
    assign unit_cents = single_list | times: keep | divided_by: 100
    assign pair_cents = pair_list | times: keep | divided_by: 100
    assign fam_cents = fam_list | times: keep | divided_by: 100
  else
    assign unit_cents = single_list
    assign pair_cents = pair_list
    assign fam_cents = fam_list
  endif

  comment
    Savings are measured against buying that many singles — the real comparison.
  endcomment
  assign pair_ref = unit_cents | times: 2
  assign fam_ref = unit_cents | times: 4
  assign pair_save = pair_ref | minus: pair_cents
  assign fam_save = fam_ref | minus: fam_cents
  assign pair_each = pair_cents | divided_by: 2
  assign fam_each = fam_cents | divided_by: 4

  assign unit_disp = unit_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_disp = pair_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_disp = fam_cents | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_each_disp = pair_each | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_each_disp = fam_each | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_save_disp = pair_save | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_save_disp = fam_save | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign single_list_disp = single_list | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign pair_list_disp = pair_list | money_without_trailing_zeros
  assign fam_list_disp = fam_list | money_without_trailing_zeros

  assign plan_product = section.settings.protection_product
  if plan_product == blank or plan_product.id == blank
    assign plan_product = all_products['priority-handling-order-goes-first']
  endif
  assign plan_variant = plan_product.first_available_variant
  assign plan_on = false
  if section.settings.show_protection and plan_variant and plan_variant.available and plan_variant.price > 0
    assign plan_on = true
    assign plan_price_disp = plan_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros
  endif
-%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#141311;
    --ink-soft:#5d5852;
    --paper:#ffffff;
    --paper-warm:#faf6f1;
    --line:#e6e0d8;
    --ember:#c8500f;
    --ember-hi:#e0631b;
    --ember-tint:#fdeee3;
    --radius-btn:10px;
    --radius-card:14px;
    --maxw:1080px;
    --shadow-soft:0 1px 2px rgba(20,19,17,.05),0 8px 24px rgba(20,19,17,.05);
    --font-display:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;
    --font-body:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;
  }
  #th-page, #th-page *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto}
    #th-page *,#th-page *::before,#th-page *::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
  }
  body{margin:0;background:var(--paper)}
  #th-page{font-family:var(--font-body);color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.55;font-size:16px}
  /* height:auto is load-bearing: HTML width/height attrs otherwise distort
     any image given width:100% in CSS (the v1 stretch bug). */
  #th-page img,#th-page svg,#th-page video{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  #th-page a{color:inherit}
  #th-page h1,#th-page h2,#th-page h3{font-family:var(--font-display);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
  #th-page h2{font-size:clamp(26px,4.5vw,38px);text-align:center;font-weight:800}
  #th-page h2 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ember)}
  #th-page .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 18px}
  #th-page section{padding:56px 0}
  #th-page .eyebrow{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);border:1px solid var(--ember);border-radius:999px;padding:4px 12px;margin-bottom:14px}
  #th-page .center{text-align:center}
  #th-page .lede{max-width:640px;margin:14px auto 0;text-align:center;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:17px}

  /* ============ announcement strip ============ */
  #th-page .announce{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:13px;padding:9px 14px;font-weight:600}
  #th-page .announce span{color:#f0b48d}
  #th-page .announce .th-timer{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#fff;background:rgba(200,80,15,.35);border-radius:6px;padding:1px 7px;margin-left:4px}

  /* ============ header ============ */
  #th-page header.th-head{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #th-page .header-in{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:58px}
  #th-page .header-in nav.th-nav{margin-left:auto}
  #th-page .logo{display:block;text-decoration:none}
  #th-page .logo img{height:22px;width:auto}
  #th-page nav.th-nav{display:flex;gap:22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}
  #th-page nav.th-nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #th-page nav.th-nav a:hover,#th-page nav.th-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--ink)}
  #th-page .cart{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-btn);padding:8px 13px;text-decoration:none}
  @media(max-width:640px){#th-page nav.th-nav{display:none}}

  /* ============ buy box ============ */
  #th-page .buybox{display:grid;gap:34px;padding-top:26px}
  @media(min-width:880px){#th-page .buybox{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;align-items:start}}
  /* No fixed aspect ratio: the frame takes the image's own shape, so nothing
     is letterboxed or cropped. Supplier images vary (1000x1000, 1000x940...). */
  #th-page .gallery-main{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);line-height:0}
  #th-page .gallery-main img,#th-page .gallery-main video{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  #th-page .thumbs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:5px;margin-top:8px}
  @media(max-width:520px){#th-page .thumbs{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}}
  #th-page .thumb{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;background:#f4efe8;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden;padding:0;transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .12s ease}
  #th-page .thumb:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
  #th-page .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  #th-page .thumb .t-tag{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(20,19,17,.62);color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.03em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 3px;text-align:center;line-height:1.25}
  #th-page .thumb .t-play{position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(20,19,17,.72);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  #th-page .thumb .t-play::after{content:"";border-style:solid;border-width:6px 0 6px 10px;border-color:transparent transparent transparent #fff;margin-left:2px}
  #th-page .thumb[aria-pressed="true"]{border:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #th-page .thumb:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}

  #th-page .trustline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;flex-wrap:wrap}
  #th-page .stars{color:var(--ember);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:15px}
  #th-page h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,40px);font-weight:800;margin:10px 0 8px}
  #th-page h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--ember)}
  #th-page .subhead{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:17px;margin-bottom:16px}
  #th-page .chipblock{margin:0 0 18px}
  #th-page .chip-lead{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:8px}
  #th-page .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
  #th-page .chips li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);border:1px solid #f3cdb2;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 10px 5px 8px;line-height:1.25}
  #th-page .chips svg{width:13px;height:13px;flex:none}
  #th-page .chip-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.45}
  #th-page .bullets{list-style:none;margin:0 0 18px}
  #th-page .bullets li{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;padding:5px 0;font-size:15.5px}
  #th-page .bullets svg{flex:none;margin-top:3px}

  #th-page .price-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;margin:6px 0 6px}
  #th-page .price-now{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:32px}
  #th-page .price-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}

  /* sale chip + countdown */
  #th-page .sale-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ember-hi),var(--ember));color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 14px;margin:2px 0 12px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(200,80,15,.28)}
  #th-page .sale-chip .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;animation:th-pulse 1.4s ease infinite}
  @keyframes th-pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:.45;transform:scale(.72)}}
  #th-page .sale-chip .th-timer{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;background:rgba(0,0,0,.22);border-radius:6px;padding:1px 8px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  #th-page .code-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:-4px 0 14px}
  #th-page .code-note b{color:var(--ember)}

  /* quantity tiles */
  #th-page .tiles{display:grid;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
  #th-page .tile{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:15px 14px;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font:inherit;width:100%;transition:transform .12s ease,box-shadow .12s ease,border-color .12s ease}
  #th-page .tile:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #th-page .tile[aria-pressed="true"]{border:2px solid var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(200,80,15,.14)}
  #th-page .tile:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}
  #th-page .tile .radio{width:18px;height:18px;border:2px solid #b9b0a4;border-radius:50%;flex:none}
  #th-page .tile[aria-pressed="true"] .radio{border-color:var(--ember);background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--ember) 0 45%,transparent 50%)}
  #th-page .tile .t-label{font-weight:700;font-size:15px}
  #th-page .tile .t-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #th-page .tile .t-sub b{color:var(--ember)}
  #th-page .tile .t-price{text-align:right}
  #th-page .tile .t-total{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:18px}
  #th-page .tile .t-compare{font-size:12.5px;color:#9a9187;text-decoration:line-through}
  #th-page .ribbon{position:absolute;top:-11px;right:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ember-hi),var(--ember));color:#fff;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase;box-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(200,80,15,.3)}
  #th-page .ribbon.alt{background:var(--ink)}

  #th-page .addon{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;gap:12px;align-items:start;border:1px dashed #d8cec1;border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:14px;margin-bottom:14px;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}
  #th-page .addon:hover{border-color:var(--ember)}
  #th-page .addon input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:0;height:0}
  #th-page .addon-box{width:20px;height:20px;border:2px solid #b9b0a4;border-radius:5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;flex:none;margin-top:1px}
  #th-page .addon-box svg{width:13px;height:13px;opacity:0}
  #th-page .addon input:checked ~ .addon-box{background:var(--ember);border-color:var(--ember)}
  #th-page .addon input:checked ~ .addon-box svg{opacity:1}
  #th-page .addon input:focus-visible ~ .addon-box{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:2px}
  #th-page .addon:has(input:checked){border-style:solid;border-color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint)}
  #th-page .addon-copy b{display:block;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:3px}
  #th-page .addon-copy span{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.45}
  #th-page .addon-copy a{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);margin-top:4px;display:inline-block}
  #th-page .addon-price{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #th-page .addon:has(input:checked) .addon-price{color:var(--ember)}
  #th-page .cta{display:block;width:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ember-hi),var(--ember));color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:var(--radius-btn);font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:17px;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(200,80,15,.28);transition:filter .12s ease,transform .12s ease}
  #th-page .cta:hover{filter:brightness(.94);transform:translateY(-1px)}
  #th-page .cta:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:2px}
  #th-page .cta small{display:block;font-family:var(--font-body);font-weight:500;font-size:12.5px;opacity:.85;margin-top:2px}
  #th-page .guarantee-line{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #th-page .payrow{display:flex;gap:7px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0}
  #th-page .payrow li{display:flex}
  #th-page .payrow .payicon,#th-page .payrow svg{height:26px;width:auto;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line)}
  #th-page .certrow{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:12px}
  #th-page .certrow li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;background:#fff}
  #th-page .certrow svg{color:var(--ember);flex:none}
  #th-page .certrow a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  #th-page .certrow a:hover{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline}

  /* ============ benefit icon row ============ */
  #th-page .icon-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0}
  @media(min-width:760px){#th-page .icon-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
  #th-page .icon-item{text-align:center;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #th-page .icon-item svg{margin:0 auto 8px}
  #th-page .icon-item strong{display:block;color:var(--ink);font-size:14.5px;margin-bottom:2px}

  /* ============ empathy / story sections ============ */
  #th-page .band{background:var(--paper-warm)}
  #th-page .split{display:grid;gap:30px;align-items:center;margin-top:34px}
  @media(min-width:820px){#th-page .split{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}#th-page .split.rev>.split-media{order:2}}
  #th-page .split h3{font-size:clamp(21px,3vw,27px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px}
  #th-page .split p{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:12px;font-size:16px}
  #th-page .split p strong{color:var(--ink)}
  /* media never fills the viewport: contained, capped, letterboxed on white */
  #th-page .split-media{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #th-page .split-media{line-height:0}
  #th-page .split-media figcaption,#th-page .fig figcaption{line-height:1.45}
  #th-page .split-media img,#th-page .split-media video{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}

  #th-page .loopbox{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:24px 22px 20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #th-page .loop{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative}
  #th-page .loop::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:17px;top:16px;bottom:16px;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(#f0d3bd,#e6dbcf)}
  #th-page .loop li{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:start;padding:9px 0}
  #th-page .loop .n{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ember);color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:15px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #fff}
  #th-page .loop b{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:16px;line-height:1.25;margin-top:6px}
  #th-page .loop span:not(.n){display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:2px}
  #th-page .loop-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--ember-tint);border-radius:10px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember)}
  #th-page .loop-foot span{font-size:17px}
  #th-page .usebox{margin-top:30px}
  #th-page .use-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:18px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#th-page .usebox .loop{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;column-gap:26px}#th-page .usebox .loop::before{display:none}}
  #th-page .loop-note{font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8177;text-align:center;margin-top:12px}
  #th-page .fig{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #th-page .fig>svg{width:100%;height:auto;overflow:visible}
  #th-page .fig figcaption{font-size:12.5px;color:#8a8177;text-align:center;margin-top:10px}
  #th-page .fig.fig-media{padding:0;overflow:hidden}
  #th-page .fig.fig-media img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;background:#fff}
  #th-page .fig.fig-media figcaption{padding:10px 14px 14px}
  #th-page .media-duo{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:30px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#th-page .media-duo{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}

  #th-page blockquote.pull{border-left:3px solid var(--ember);padding:6px 0 6px 18px;margin:18px 0;font-size:17px;font-style:italic}
  #th-page blockquote.pull footer{font-style:normal;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}

  /* ============ comparison table ============ */
  #th-page .swipe-hint{display:none;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);margin:18px 0 -14px}
  @media(max-width:880px){#th-page .swipe-hint{display:block}}
  #th-page .compare-outer{position:relative;margin-top:34px}
  #th-page .compare-outer .edge-fade{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:56px;background:linear-gradient(to left,#fff 15%,rgba(255,255,255,0));pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s ease;border-radius:0 var(--radius-card) var(--radius-card) 0}
  #th-page .compare-outer.at-end .edge-fade{opacity:0}
  #th-page .compare-scroll{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  #th-page table.compare{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;min-width:640px;font-size:14px}
  #th-page .compare th,#th-page .compare td{padding:12px 14px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #th-page .compare th:first-child,#th-page .compare td:first-child{text-align:left;font-weight:600;min-width:150px;position:sticky;left:0;background:var(--paper);z-index:2;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
  #th-page .compare thead th{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;font-size:13.5px}
  #th-page .compare .you{background:var(--ember-tint);border-left:2px solid var(--ember);border-right:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #th-page .compare thead .you{border-top:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:10px 10px 0 0}
  #th-page .compare tbody tr:last-child .you{border-bottom:2px solid var(--ember)}
  #th-page .yes{color:var(--ember);font-weight:800}
  #th-page .no{color:#b9b0a4;font-weight:700}

  /* ============ reviews ============ */
  #th-page .reviews{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:34px}
  @media(min-width:820px){#th-page .reviews{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
  #th-page .review{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:20px;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #th-page .review .stars{font-size:13px}
  #th-page .review p{font-size:14.5px;margin:10px 0}
  #th-page .review footer{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700}
  #th-page .review footer span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:600}
  #th-page .review .answers{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ember);background:var(--ember-tint);border-radius:999px;padding:2px 9px}

  /* ============ specs / fit ============ */
  #th-page .spec-grid{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-top:30px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#th-page .spec-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
  #th-page .spec{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:18px;background:#fff;font-size:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #th-page .spec strong{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:5px}
  #th-page .spec span{color:var(--ink-soft)}

  #th-page .details{display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:30px}
  @media(min-width:760px){#th-page .details{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
  #th-page .details figure{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);overflow:hidden;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #th-page .details img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
  #th-page .details figcaption{padding:14px 16px 16px}
  #th-page .details figcaption b{display:block;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:15px;margin-bottom:4px}
  #th-page .details figcaption span{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5}
  #th-page .founder{border:1px dashed #c9bfb2;border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:#fff;padding:26px;margin-top:34px}
  #th-page .founder .tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;color:#8a8177;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
  #th-page .founder p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:10px}

  #th-page .gbox{max-width:680px;margin:34px auto 0;border:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:30px;text-align:center;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft)}
  #th-page .gbox h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px}
  #th-page .gbox p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:15.5px;margin-bottom:8px}
  #th-page .gbox .seal{width:64px;height:64px;margin:0 auto 14px;border:2px solid var(--ember);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;color:var(--ember);font-size:13px;line-height:1.1;text-align:center}

  /* ============ FAQ ============ */
  #th-page .faq{max-width:720px;margin:34px auto 0}
  #th-page .faq-item{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden}
  #th-page .faq-q{width:100%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:none;border:none;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:15.5px;text-align:left;padding:17px 18px;cursor:pointer}
  #th-page .faq-q:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--ember);outline-offset:-3px}
  #th-page .faq-q .pm{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:800;color:var(--ember);font-size:20px;flex:none}
  #th-page .faq-a{padding:0 18px 17px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);display:none}
  #th-page .faq-item.open .faq-a{display:block}

  /* ============ final offer / footer ============ */
  #th-page .final{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
  #th-page .final h2{color:#fff}
  #th-page .final .lede{color:#c9c2b9}
  #th-page .final .cta{max-width:420px;margin:26px auto 0}
  #th-page .final .guarantee-line{color:#c9c2b9}
  #th-page footer.site{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #th-page .trustbar{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:20px;color:var(--ink)}
  #th-page .disclaimer{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;line-height:1.6}

  /* ============ sticky bottom bar ============ */
  #th-page .stickybar{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 -4px 18px rgba(20,19,17,.08);transform:translateY(110%);transition:transform .25s ease;padding:10px 14px}
  #th-page .stickybar.show{transform:translateY(0)}
  #th-page .stickybar-in{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  #th-page .stickybar .mini{width:44px;height:44px;flex:none;border-radius:8px;object-fit:cover}
  #th-page .stickybar .info{flex:1;min-width:0}
  #th-page .stickybar .info b{display:block;font-size:13.5px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
  #th-page .stickybar .info span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  #th-page .stickybar .cta{width:auto;padding:13px 22px;font-size:15px}
  @media(max-width:480px){#th-page .stickybar .info span em{display:none}}
</style>

<div id="th-page">

<!-- 1 ▸ ANNOUNCEMENT STRIP -->
<div class="announce">
  Free UK delivery · <span>30-day money-back guarantee</span> · 2-year warranty
</div>

<!-- 2 ▸ STICKY HEADER -->
<header class="th-head">
  <div class="wrap header-in">
    <a class="logo" href="#top" aria-label="Thermora home">
      <img src="{{ 'thermora-logo.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="Thermora" width="158" height="32">
    </a>
    <nav class="th-nav" aria-label="Main">
      <a href="#how">How it works</a>
      <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
      <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- 3 ▸ BUY BOX -->
<section id="buy" style="padding-top:10px">
  <div class="wrap buybox" id="top">
    <div>
      <div class="gallery-main" id="galleryMain">
        <img src="{{ 'th-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Thermora heated knee massager: grey neoprene wrap with a touch control panel and digital display" width="1000" height="1000" fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
      <div class="thumbs" role="group" aria-label="Product photos">
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="true" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'th-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Thermora heated knee massager: grey neoprene wrap with a touch control panel and digital display" aria-label="Photo 1: the wrap">
          <img src="{{ 'th-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-tag">The wrap</span>
        </button>
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="false" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'th-heat-levels.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Five infrared heating levels: 45, 50, 55, 60 and 65 degrees Celsius" aria-label="Photo 2: five heat levels">
          <img src="{{ 'th-heat-levels.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-tag">5 heat levels</span>
        </button>
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="false" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'th-controls.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Large LCD panel with separate plus and minus buttons for temperature and massage intensity" aria-label="Photo 3: the controls">
          <img src="{{ 'th-controls.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-tag">Big buttons</span>
        </button>
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="false" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'th-fit-dimensions.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Wrap dimensions: 46 cm across, 30 cm tall, with a 55 cm adjustable strap span" aria-label="Photo 4: will it fit?">
          <img src="{{ 'th-fit-dimensions.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-tag">Will it fit?</span>
        </button>
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="false" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'th-vibration.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="Three vibration intensities: gentle for daily care, comfortable for post-exercise recovery, strong for deep massage" aria-label="Photo 5: three vibration intensities">
          <img src="{{ 'th-vibration.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-tag">3 strengths</span>
        </button>
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="false" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'th-multi-joint.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="A man in his sixties wearing the wrap on his shoulder, his upper arm, one knee, then both knees" aria-label="Photo 6: shoulder, elbow and knee">
          <img src="{{ 'th-multi-joint.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-tag">3 joints</span>
        </button>
        <button class="thumb" aria-pressed="false" data-type="img" data-src="{{ 'th-in-box.jpg' | asset_url }}" data-alt="In the box: the massager, the extension strap, a USB-C charging cable and an instruction manual" aria-label="Photo 6: what's in the box">
          <img src="{{ 'th-in-box.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="t-tag">In the box</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="trustline">
        <span class="stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
        <span>Verified customer reviews{% if section.settings.review_count > 0 %} · {{ section.settings.review_count }} and counting{% endif %}</span>
      </div>

      <h1>Loosen a stiff joint <em>in one 30-minute session.</em></h1>
      <p class="subhead">Five levels of infrared heat and three massage strengths. Strap it on your knee, shoulder or elbow, sit back, and let it work on whatever aches this morning.</p>

      {%- comment -%} Condition chips. Framing is deliberately "used daily by
          people with" — a factual statement about who buys it, NOT "helps
          with <condition>", which is the phrasing the ASA has repeatedly
          banned. Editable in section settings; the qualifier line under it
          is not optional and stays whatever the list says. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign chips = section.settings.condition_chips | split: ',' -%}
      {%- if chips.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="chipblock">
        <p class="chip-lead">{{ section.settings.condition_lead | default: 'Used daily by people with:' }}</p>
        <ul class="chips" role="list">
          {%- for c in chips -%}
            {%- assign c = c | strip -%}
            {%- if c != blank -%}
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>{{ c }}</li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
        <p class="chip-note">Warmth and massage for comfort, on the knee, shoulder or elbow. Not a treatment for any condition.</p>
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <ul class="bullets">
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8500f" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Knee, shoulder or elbow.</strong> The extension strap in the box moves it wherever the ache is</span></li>
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8500f" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Five heat levels, 45°C to 65°C.</strong> Pick your warmth. A wheat bag is cold in ten minutes</span></li>
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8500f" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>Three massage strengths.</strong> Gentle, comfortable or strong, chosen on a big lit panel</span></li>
        <li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8500f" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span><strong>CE tested, with safety built in.</strong> Controlled heat, a screen lock, and a 30-minute auto shut-off you cannot override</span></li>
      </ul>

      {%- if sale_on -%}
      <div class="sale-chip sale-only" role="status">
        <span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Summer Sale · ends 1 Sept ·&nbsp;<b class="th-timer" data-end="{{ sale_end }}">…</b>
      </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <div class="price-row">
        <span class="price-now" id="priceMain">{{ pair_disp }}</span>
        <span class="price-note" id="priceNote">for 2 · free UK delivery</span>
      </div>

      <div class="tiles" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Choose your pack">
        <button type="button" class="tile" role="radio" aria-pressed="false" aria-checked="false"
                data-qty="1" data-variant="{{ v_single.id }}"
                data-total="{{ unit_disp }}" data-note="for 1 · free UK delivery" data-sticky="single">
          <span class="radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span><span class="t-label">Single, 1 wrap</span><br><span class="t-sub">For one joint</span></span>
          <span class="t-price"><span class="t-total">{{ unit_disp }}</span>{% if sale_on %}<br><span class="t-compare sale-only">{{ single_list_disp }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="tile" role="radio" aria-pressed="true" aria-checked="true"
                data-qty="2" data-variant="{{ v_pair.id }}"
                data-total="{{ pair_disp }}" data-note="for 2 · free UK delivery" data-sticky="pair">
          <span class="ribbon">Most popular</span>
          <span class="radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span><span class="t-label">Pair, 2 wraps</span><br><span class="t-sub">Both knees, or a knee and a shoulder · <b>save {{ pair_save_disp }}</b></span></span>
          <span class="t-price"><span class="t-total">{{ pair_disp }}</span><br><span class="t-compare">{{ pair_ref | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</span></span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="tile" role="radio" aria-pressed="false" aria-checked="false"
                data-qty="4" data-variant="{{ v_family.id }}"
                data-total="{{ fam_disp }}" data-note="for 4 · free UK delivery" data-sticky="4-pack">
          <span class="ribbon alt">Best value</span>
          <span class="radio" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span><span class="t-label">Family, 4 wraps</span><br><span class="t-sub">{{ fam_each_disp }} each · <b>save {{ fam_save_disp }}</b></span></span>
          <span class="t-price"><span class="t-total">{{ fam_disp }}</span><br><span class="t-compare">{{ fam_ref | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</span></span>
        </button>
      </div>

      {%- if sale_on -%}
      <p class="code-note sale-only">Summer Sale price: {{ sale_pct }}% off every pack, applied at checkout. No code needed.</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if plan_on -%}
      <label class="addon" for="wdPlan">
        <input type="checkbox" id="thPlan" data-variant="{{ plan_variant.id }}" data-price="{{ plan_price_disp }}">
        <span class="addon-box" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>
        <span class="addon-copy">
          <b>Priority handling, {{ plan_price_disp }}</b>
          <span>We push your order to the front of the queue. Not dispatched in 3 working days, fee refunded.</span>
          <a href="{{ plan_product.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Details</a>
        </span>
        <span class="addon-price" id="thPlanTotal">+{{ plan_price_disp }}</span>
      </label>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if wired -%}
      <form method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" id="lpBuyForm">
        {%- comment -%} No-JS fallback lands on checkout; the JS path clears the cart first so repeat clicks replace rather than stack. {%- endcomment -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/checkout">
        <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v_pair.id }}" id="lpVariant">
        <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1" id="lpQty">
        <button type="submit" class="cta" id="mainCta">Add to cart, <span id="ctaPrice">{{ pair_disp }}</span></button>
      </form>
      {%- else -%}
      {%- comment -%} No sellable variant resolved (product missing, unpublished
          or priced at £0): never render a broken checkout. {%- endcomment -%}
      <button type="button" class="cta" id="mainCta" data-unwired="true">Add to cart, <span id="ctaPrice">{{ pair_disp }}</span></button>
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="guarantee-line">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c8500f" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        30-day money-back guarantee · 2-year warranty · UK support
      </p>
      {%- comment -%} Official Shopify payment icons: renders only the methods
          actually enabled on this store, so the row can never advertise a
          payment type customers can't use at checkout. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
      <ul class="payrow" role="list" aria-label="Payment methods accepted">
        {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
          <li>{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'payicon' }}</li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Compliance strip. Only the two genuine, product-matching
          certificates are shown (CE/EMC + RoHS, TST reports for model MY-017,
          May 2024). Badges link to the PDFs once the owner uploads them to
          Shopify Files and pastes the URLs in section settings; without a URL
          they stay as plain, unlinked statements of fact. {%- endcomment -%}
      <ul class="certrow" role="list" aria-label="Product compliance">
        <li>
          <a href="{{ section.settings.cert_ce_url | default: 'th-ce-certificate.jpg' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          CE tested (EMC)</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M9 6h6"/></svg>
          USB-C rechargeable
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg>
          Auto shut-off
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4 ▸ BENEFIT ICON ROW -->
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="icon-row">
    <div class="icon-item">
      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#141311" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.9 4.9l2.8 2.8M16.3 16.3l2.8 2.8M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.9 19.1l2.8-2.8M16.3 7.7l2.8-2.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5"/></svg>
      <strong>5 heat levels</strong>45°C up to 65°C
    </div>
    <div class="icon-item">
      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#141311" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12h3l2-7 4 14 3-10 2 3h6"/></svg>
      <strong>3 massage strengths</strong>Gentle, comfortable, strong
